	(text "Iskanje: Current Sense Through Hole Resistors\n\nShunt:  0.25 Ohm    PWR221T-30-R250F | Bourns | 30W | 1% | TO-220 | 5,5€ | https://www.newark.com/bourns/pwr221t-30-r250f/res-thick-film-0r25-1-30w-to-220/dp/06X6724\nShunt: 15.00 Ohm    PWR221T-30-15R0J | Bourns | https://www.newark.com/bourns/pwr221t-30-15r0j/res-thick-film-15r-5-30w-to-220/dp/06X6736\n\nPullup: \nMust be 2570 < R < 2650\npackage | standard | 1/4W | R_Axial_DIN0207_L6.3mm_D2.5mm_P15.24mm_Horizontal |\n\nRelay:\nTQ2-2M-24V | Signal Relay, 24 VDC, DPDT, 2 A, TQ Series, Through Hole, Non Latching\nSignal Relay: DS1E-M-DC24V | Coil Current 16.7 mA\n\nClassic relay: RT424024 |24V DPDT Coil Switch | RT Series THT Footprint\n\nReed Relay:\nSIL24-1A72-71L | Reed Relay, SPST-NO, 24 VDC, SIL Series, Through Hole, 2 kohm, 1 A\n\n200MSP3T1B1M2QEH\nToggle Switch, Subminiature, On-Off-On, SPDT, Non Illuminated, 200 Series, Through Hole, 3 A\nhttps://si.farnell.com/e-switch/200msp3t1b1m2qeh/toggle-switch-spdt-3a-120vac/dp/4050983"
